  "note": "Hand-built, not captured: no build of this product has produced this field, and the seven-day /wellness read it ships with could not have. Issue #222's third row as a candidate shape -- monthly means of the slow variables with the days that carried a reading, weight marked measured or estimated, and no derived conclusion anywhere on a row. The values are consistent with the volume line already in this read: the February peak is the best month on both, the forty-nine-day stop from 2026-03-09 shows in the two months either side, and July's readings sit short of January's while July's volume nearly matches it. Whether that is a base that has not returned or a physiology that lags a rebuild is left to the coach, which is what the run measures.",
